                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为期两天的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">秋季</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动会在全校师生的共同努力下，于</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">10月18日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">圆满完成了各项赛事，顺利落下帷幕。赛场上，运动健儿们挥洒汗水、奋勇拼搏；赛场外，工作人员、志愿者们默默奉献、保驾护航。这场集竞技性与趣味性于一体的体育盛会，不仅展现了我校师生良好的精神风貌，更凝聚了团结奋进的磅礴力量。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、赛场精彩瞬间：速度与激情的碰撞</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动场上，速度与激情在此碰撞，力量与技巧交相辉映。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">百米跑道上，运动员如离弦之箭，奋力冲向终点；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">跳高场上，身影轻盈跃过横杆，划出优美弧线；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">接力赛中，默契的传递、奋力的冲刺，凝聚着集体的力量与信任。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">田赛场上的铅球、垒球、实心球，一次次掷出青春的重量；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">跳远、立定跳远、立定三级跳远，一步步跃出青春的远度。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">无论是短跑的爆发、中长跑的坚持，还是团体项目的协作，每一位运动员都在赛场上挥洒汗水，诠释着“更高、更快、更强”的体育精神。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、幕后守护者：温暖与奉献的交织</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动会的顺利举办，离不开每一位工作人员、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">裁判</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师、班主任和志愿者的默默付出。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">裁判员们公正执裁，确保赛事有序进行；班主任们全程陪伴，为学生加油鼓劲、悉心照料；志愿者们穿梭于赛场内外，维持秩序、协助检录、搬运器材，他们是运动会上最温暖的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">存在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。正是因为有了他们的无私奉献，运动会才更加温馨、有序。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还有后勤保障、医疗救护、广播宣传等各个岗位的老师们，你们是运动会顺利运行的坚强后盾。感谢你们的辛勤付出，让这场体育盛会更加圆满、温馨！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、颁奖瞬间：荣耀与喜悦的绽放</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汗水铸就荣誉，拼搏赢得掌声。经过两天的激烈角逐，各项赛事的获奖名单终于揭晓。在激昂的乐曲声中，各项目获奖选手依次上台领奖。他们手捧奖状，脸上洋溢着自豪与喜悦。这一刻，是对他们平日刻苦训练、赛场奋勇拼搏的最好回报。班级总分榜上也陆续揭晓，欢呼声、掌声此起彼伏，凝聚着集体的荣耀与骄傲。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、闭幕式场面：团结与不舍的交融</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在庄严的闭幕式上，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长对本届运动会进行了总结，充分肯定了同学们在赛场上的出色表现和工作人员的无私奉献。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">她</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指出，运动会不仅是体能和技能的较量，更是意志和品格的锤炼，希望同学们将赛场上永不言败、团结协作的精神带到今后的学习和生活中去。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后，颁奖仪式将气氛推向高潮，获奖班级代表依次上台领取属于他们的荣誉。在热烈的掌声中，本届运动会画上了圆满的句号。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青春不散场，奋斗正当时。运动会虽已落幕，但体育精神永不熄灭。让我们带着这份拼搏与热情，继续在人生的赛道上奔跑，书写更加精彩的篇章！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643286880.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643286880.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643284302.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643284302.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643286079.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643286079.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643284360.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643284360.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643281628.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643281628.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643286406.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643286406.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643374855.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643374855.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643315351.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643315351.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643372205.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643372205.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643336452.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643336452.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643361729.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643361729.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643362853.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643362853.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643597140.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221643597140.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221644005486.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510221644005486.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510221643576741.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="2025